  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large wok over medium heat",
    "Add the onion and cook until it is lightly browned",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the lentils, water, and salt, and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes",
    "Stir in the crushed marzipan and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Serve the curry in a scallop shell and garnish with chopped peanuts"
